#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:3
msgid "Functional Testing"
msgstr "Funktionel test"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:5
msgid ""
"Functional tests test software the way a user would. They simulate a user "
"browsing the website, but they do these steps in an automated way. phpBB "
"allows you to write such tests. This document will tell you how."
msgstr ""
"Funktionelle tests tester software på samme måde, som en bruger ville gøre. "
"De simulerer en bruger, der browser på webstedet, men de udfører disse trin "
"på en automatiseret måde. phpBB giver dig mulighed for at skrive sådanne "
"tests. Dette dokument vil fortælle dig hvordan."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:10
msgid "Running Functional Tests"
msgstr "Kørsel af funktionelle tests"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:12
msgid ""
"Information on how to run tests is available in the GitHub repository at "
"`<https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/blob/3.2.x/tests/RUNNING_TESTS.md>`_. You "
"can switch the branch to check instructions for a specific version of phpBB."
msgstr ""
"Information om, hvordan man kører tests, er tilgængelig i GitHub-"
"repositoryet på "
"`<https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/blob/3.2.x/tests/RUNNING_TESTS.md>`_. Du "
"kan skifte branch for at se instruktioner for en bestemt version af phpBB."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:17
msgid "Writing Functional Tests"
msgstr "Skrivning af funktionelle tests"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:19
msgid ""
"Your test case will have to inherit from the ``phpbb_functional_test_case`` "
"class. You will be able to make requests to a fresh phpBB installation. "
"Also, be sure to put the file into the ``tests/functional/`` folder and to "
"add the ``@group functional`` doc block above the class, so the tests are "
"correctly executed."
msgstr ""
"Din test case skal arve fra klassen ``phpbb_functional_test_case``. Du vil "
"kunne lave forespørgsler til en frisk phpBB-installation. Sørg også for at "
"placere filen i mappen ``tests/functional/`` og tilføje doc-blokken ``@group"
" functional`` over klassen, så testene udføres korrekt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:47
msgid ""
"There is a ``bootstrap()`` method where you can put code that is run before "
"the test. Here you can set up some objects after the installation that are "
"required for your test. Then you can define your tests, just as you would "
"normally, by prefixing methods with ``test_``. In this case we will be "
"testing the index."
msgstr ""
"Der findes en metode ``bootstrap()``, hvor du kan placere kode, der køres "
"før testen. Her kan du opsætte nogle objekter efter installationen, som er "
"nødvendige for din test. Derefter kan du definere dine tests som normalt, "
"ved at prefikse metoder med ``test_``. I dette tilfælde vil vi teste "
"indekset."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:53
msgid "Goutte and Assertions"
msgstr "Goutte og assertions"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:55
msgid ""
"The functional testing framework is built using `Goutte "
"<https://github.com/fabpot/Goutte>`_, which makes HTTP requests and allows "
"us to interact with the page. The Goutte \"client\" is available in your "
"tests through ``$this->request($method, $path)``. Alternatively you can also"
" access it directly through ``$this->client``."
msgstr ""
"Frameworket til funktionel test er bygget ved hjælp af `Goutte "
"<https://github.com/fabpot/Goutte>`_, som laver HTTP-forespørgsler og giver "
"os mulighed for at interagere med siden. Goutte-\"klienten\" er tilgængelig "
"i dine tests via ``$this->request($method, $path)``. Alternativt kan du også"
" tilgå den direkte via ``$this->client``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:61
msgid ""
"When calling ``request()``, you will get a crawler, which allows you to "
"fetch parts of the page using CSS selectors. Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"Når du kalder ``request()``, får du en crawler, som giver dig mulighed for "
"at hente dele af siden ved hjælp af CSS-selektorer. Her er et eksempel:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:82
msgid ""
"We perform a GET request to ``index.php``, then apply a CSS filter, querying"
" for the .topiclist class. Then we make sure our query matched something."
msgstr ""
"Vi udfører en GET-forespørgsel til ``index.php``, og anvender derefter et "
"CSS-filter, som forespørger på klassen .topiclist. Derefter sikrer vi os, at"
" vores forespørgsel matchede noget."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:85
msgid ""
"If the board's index page were broken, our test would catch this, allowing "
"us to detect the issue and fix it. The more things you test, the more "
"breakages you will catch early."
msgstr ""
"Hvis forummets indeksside var i stykker, ville vores test opdage dette, "
"hvilket giver os mulighed for at opdage problemet og rette det. Jo flere "
"ting du tester, jo flere fejl fanger du tidligt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:89
msgid ""
"For more information what you can do with Goutte, check out the `GitHub "
"project <https://github.com/fabpot/Goutte>`_, `Ryan Weaver's Goutte tutorial"
" <http://www.phparch.com/2010/04/four-new-php-5-3-components-and-goutte-a-"
"simple-web-scraper/>`_ and `Symfony's testing documentation "
"<http://symfony.com/doc/2.0/book/testing.html#the-test-client>`_."
msgstr ""
"For mere information om, hvad du kan gøre med Goutte, se `GitHub-projektet "
"<https://github.com/fabpot/Goutte>`_, `Ryan Weavers Goutte-tutorial "
"<http://www.phparch.com/2010/04/four-new-php-5-3-components-and-goutte-a-"
"simple-web-scraper/>`_ og `Symfonys testdokumentation "
"<http://symfony.com/doc/2.0/book/testing.html#the-test-client>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:95
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autentificering"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:97
msgid ""
"Many functional tests will require the user to be logged in. To do so, you "
"can use the ``login()`` method inherited from the "
"``phpbb_functional_test_case`` class. This method will assign the user's SID"
" to the inherited class property ``$this->sid``. You will need to append "
"this to the URLs that the logged-in user will be navigating to in order to "
"hold the session. For usage examples, view the logout test in "
"`tests/functional/auth_test.php "
"<https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/blob/3.2.x/tests/functional/auth_test.php>`_."
msgstr ""
"Mange funktionelle tests kræver, at brugeren er logget ind. For at gøre "
"dette kan du bruge metoden ``login()``, der arves fra klassen "
"``phpbb_functional_test_case``. Denne metode vil tildele brugerens SID til "
"den arvede klasseegenskab ``$this->sid``. Du skal tilføje denne til de "
"URL'er, den indloggede bruger navigerer til, for at bevare sessionen. For "
"brugseksempler, se logout-testen i `tests/functional/auth_test.php "
"<https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/blob/3.2.x/tests/functional/auth_test.php>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:106
msgid "Localisation"
msgstr "Lokalisering"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:108
msgid ""
"In tests, as in phpBB itself, do not use hard-coded language unless "
"absolutely necessary. Instead, use the ``$this->add_lang()`` and "
"``$this->lang()`` methods. Both act very similarly to their counterparts in "
"the ``\\phpbb\\user`` class. Note that ``language/en/common.php`` is "
"automatically loaded by the test framework."
msgstr ""
"I tests, ligesom i selve phpBB, bør du ikke bruge hardkodet sprog, medmindre"
" det er absolut nødvendigt. Brug i stedet metoderne ``$this->add_lang()`` og"
" ``$this->lang()``. Begge opfører sig meget lig deres modstykker i klassen "
"``\\phpbb\\user``. Bemærk, at ``language/en/common.php`` automatisk indlæses"
" af testframeworket."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/testing/functional_testing.rst:131
msgid ""
"For more usage examples, please view `tests/functional/lang_test.php "
"<https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/blob/3.2.x/tests/functional/lang_test.php>`_."
msgstr ""
"For flere brugseksempler, se venligst `tests/functional/lang_test.php "
"<https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/blob/3.2.x/tests/functional/lang_test.php>`_."
